{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K74Nsi6AipzRnDUXCbjGqn","type":"tool_result","content":"CHANGELOG.md:35:- **VS Code extension** - Syntax highlighting for Vue sigils (`~VUE`)\nCHANGELOG.md:198:This version transitions the default client-side setup to TypeScript and renames ~V sigil to ~VUE. If you have an existing `assets/vue/index.js`, follow these steps to upgrade:\nguides/comparison.md:19:| **Sigil DSL** | ✅ (`~VUE`) | ✅ (`~V`) | ❌ | ❌ |\nguides/basic_usage.md:546:## Using ~VUE Sigil\nguides/basic_usage.md:548:The `~VUE` sigil provides an alternative to the standard LiveView DSL, allowing you to write Vue components directly in your LiveView:\nguides/basic_usage.md:552:> The `~V` sigil is deprecated in favor of `~VUE`. It will be removed in future versions.\nguides/basic_usage.md:559:    ~VUE\"\"\"\nguides/basic_usage.md:588:The `~VUE` sigil is a powerful macro that compiles the string content into a full-fledged Vue component at compile time. It automatically passes all of the LiveView's `assigns` as props to the component, making it easy to create reactive components.\nguides/basic_usage.md:590:**When to use the `~VUE` sigil:**\nguides/getting_started.md:200:- [Basic Usage](basic_usage.md) for more patterns and the ~VUE sigil\nlib/live_vue.ex:316:  @deprecated \"~V sigil is deprecated, please use ~VUE instead.\"\n.ralph-tui/session.json:97:        \"title\": \"US-007: Implement ~VUE and ~REACT sigils\",\nCLAUDE.md:23:├── live_vue.ex              # Main module, ~VUE sigil\nCLAUDE.md:45:# Or with ~VUE sigil\nCLAUDE.md:46:~VUE\"\"\"\nREADME.md:18:-   🪄 **~VUE Sigil** as an alternative LiveView DSL with VS Code syntax highlighting\nREADME.md:113:For syntax highlighting of the `~VUE` sigil:\nREADME.md:123: - [Basic Usage](guides/basic_usage.md) - Fundamental patterns, ~VUE sigil, and common examples\nREADME.md:193:- [x] VS Code extension - syntax highlighting for `~VUE` sigil\ntasks/prd-live-vite.md:15:- Provide framework-specific sigils (`~VUE`, `~REACT`) and component helpers\ntasks/prd-live-vite.md:97:### US-007: Implement ~VUE and ~REACT sigils\ntasks/prd-live-vite.md:102:- [ ] `~VUE` sigil works as the existing `~VUE` sigil does today"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SzoENcH6Ai7NwA6972BSx3","session_id":"64a1054d-d5d1-470b-988c-6d3926af5d5d","uuid":"0c3cf1cb-0eb2-4ef8-906f-c537ca038a6c"}
