LiveVue.vue()` → `LiveVite.vue()`\n\n3. `lib/live_vue/encoder.ex` - Change ALL occurrences:\n   - `LiveVue.Encoder` → `LiveVite.Encoder` (many occurrences - in protocol def, defimpl, docs, etc.)\n   - `Application.get_env(:live_vue,` → `Application.get_env(:live_vite,`\n   - `for LiveVue` in doc text → `for LiveVite`\n\n4. `lib/live_vue/slots.ex` - Change:\n   - `defmodule LiveVue.Slots do` → `defmodule LiveVite.Slots do`\n\n5. `lib/live_vue/reload.ex` - Change:\n   - `defmodule LiveVue.Reload do` → `defmodule LiveVite.Reload do`\n   - `Application.get_env(:live_vue,` → `Application.get_env(:live_vite,`\n   - `LiveVue.SSR.ViteJS.vite_path` → `LiveVite.SSR.ViteJS.vite_path` (2 occurrences)\n\n6. `lib/live_vue/ssr.ex` - Change:\n   - `defmodule LiveVue.SSR.NotConfigured do` → `defmodule LiveVite.SSR.NotConfigured do`\n   - `defmodule LiveVue.SSR do` → `defmodule LiveVite.SSR do`\n   - `config :live_vue` in docs → `config :live_vite`\n   - `[:live_vue, :ssr]` → `[:live_vite, :ssr]`\n   - `Application.get_env(:live_vue,` → `Application.get_env(:live_vite,`\n\n7. `lib/live_vue/ssr/node_js.ex` - Change:\n   - `defmodule LiveVue.SSR.NodeJS do` → `defmodule LiveVite.SSR.NodeJS do`\n   - `@behaviour LiveVue.SSR` → `@behaviour LiveVite.SSR`\n   - `Application.get_env(:live_vue,` → `Application.get_env(:live_vite,`\n   - `LiveVue.SSR.NodeJS.server_path` → `LiveVite.SSR.NodeJS.server_path` (in error message)\n   - `LiveVue.SSR.NotConfigured` → `LiveVite.SSR.NotConfigured`\n\n8. `lib/live_vue/ssr/vite_js.ex` - Change:\n   - `defmodule LiveVue.SSR.ViteJS do` → `defmodule LiveVite.SSR.ViteJS do`\n   - `@behaviour LiveVue.SSR` → `@behaviour LiveVite.SSR`\n   - `liveVuePlugin` → `liveVitePlugin` in docstring\n   - `import liveVuePlugin from \"live_vue/vitePlugin\"` → `import liveVitePlugin from \"live_vite/vitePlugin\"` in docstring\n   - `Application.get_env(:live_vue,` → `Application.get_env(:live_vite,` (2 occurrences)\n   - `config :live_vue` in error message → `config :live_vite`\n   - `LiveVue.SSR.NotConfigured` → `LiveVite.SSR.NotConfigured`\n\n9. `lib/live_vue/test.ex` - Change:\n   - `defmodule LiveVue.Test do` → `defmodule LiveVite.Test do`\n   - All `LiveVue.Test` references in docs → `LiveVite.Test`\n   - `config :live_vue` → `config :live_vite`\n   - `LiveVue root` → `LiveVite root`\n   - `LiveVue.Test.get_vue` → `LiveVite.Test.get_vue`\n   - `\"LazyHTML is not installed...\"` error message: `LiveVue.Test` → `LiveVite.Test`\n   - In the moduledoc, change LiveVue references to LiveVite where they refer to the library name\n\n10. `lib/mix/tasks/live_vue.install.ex` - Change:\n    - `defmodule Mix.Tasks.LiveVue.Install do` → `defmodule Mix.Tasks.LiveVite.Install do`\n    - `mix live_vue.install` → `mix live_vite.install`\n    - All `LiveVue` module references → `LiveVite`\n    - All `live_vue` config keys → `live_vite`\n    - `\"live_vue\"` in package.json template → `\"live_vite\"`\n    - `\"live_vue/vitePlugin\"` → `\"live_vite/vitePlugin\"`\n    - `\"live_vue/server\"` → `\"live_vite/server\"`\n    - `from \"live_vue\"` → `from \"live_vite\"`\n    - `createLiveVue` → `createLiveVite`\n    - `liveVuePlugin` → `liveVitePlugin`\n    - `liveVueApp` → `liveViteApp`\n    - `live_vue-start` → `live_vite-start`\n    - `live_vue-end` → `live_vite-end`\n    - `\"Welcome to LiveVue!\"` → `\"Welcome to LiveVite!\"` in the demo template\n    - `\"LiveVue Features\"` → `\"LiveVite Features\"` in the demo template\n    - `LiveVue app` → `LiveVite app` in the demo template\n    - `\"LiveVue basics\"` → `\"LiveVite basics\"` in the demo template\n    - `\"Congratulations, you've successfully created a LiveVue app\"` → `LiveVite app`\n    - In the installer task error message: `live_vue.install` → `live_vite.install`\n\nUse the Edit tool for each change. Use `replace_all: true` when the pattern is unique enough that replacing all occurrences is safe (like `LiveVue.Encoder` → `LiveVite.Encoder` in encoder.ex).\n\nDo ALL edits. Be thorough.","subagen