ook_progress\",\"hookEvent\":\"PostToolUse\",\"hookName\":\"PostToolUse:Read\",\"command\":\"callback\"},\"parentToolUseID\":\"toolu_018TFifwNJGBhsXpbV2G41uy\",\"toolUseID\":\"toolu_018TFifwNJGBhsXpbV2G41uy\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-11T03:10:58.947Z\",\"uuid\":\"3eb0811b-c4b7-451c-8397-c0163edf9510\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"b0cbf225-21c5-4efc-8c9a-0772a4613d71\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"userType\":\"external\",\"cwd\":\"/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue\",\"sessionId\":\"64a1054d-d5d1-470b-988c-6d3926af5d5d\",\"version\":\"2.1.32\",\"gitBranch\":\"main\",\"agentId\":\"a1f5895\",\"slug\":\"ticklish-crafting-duckling\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_018TFifwNJGBhsXpbV2G41uy\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"     1→defmodule LiveVue.Reload do\\n     2→  @moduledoc \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n     3→  Utilities for easier integration with Vite in development\\n     4→  \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n     5→\\n     6→  use Phoenix.Component\\n     7→\\n     8→  attr :assets, :list, required: true\\n     9→  slot :inner_block, required: true, doc: \\\"what should be rendered when Vite path is not defined\\\"\\n    10→\\n    11→  @doc \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    12→  Renders the vite assets in development, and in production falls back to normal compiled assets\\n    13→  \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    14→  def vite_assets(assigns) do\\n    15→    assigns =\\n    16→      assigns\\n    17→      |> assign(:stylesheets, for(path <- assigns.assets, String.ends_with?(path, \\\".css\\\"), do: path))\\n    18→      |> assign(:javascripts, for(path <- assigns.assets, String.ends_with?(path, \\\".js\\\"), do: path))\\n    19→\\n    20→    # TODO - maybe make it configurable in other way than by presence of vite_host config?\\n    21→    ~H\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    22→    <%= if Application.get_env(:live_vue, :vite_host) do %>\\n    23→      <script type=\\\"module\\\" src={LiveVue.SSR.ViteJS.vite_path(\\\"@vite/client\\\")}>\\n    24→      </script>\\n    25→      <link :for={path <- @stylesheets} rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href={LiveVue.SSR.ViteJS.vite_path(path)} />\\n    26→      <script :for={path <- @javascripts} type=\\\"module\\\" src={LiveVue.SSR.ViteJS.vite_path(path)}>\\n    27→      </script>\\n    28→    <% else %>\\n    29→      {render_slot(@inner_block)}\\n    30→    <% end %>\\n    31→    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    32→  end\\n    33→end\\n    34→\\n\\n<system-reminder>\\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\\n</system-reminder>\\n\"}]},\"uuid\":\"2fcdb910-d4f7-4670-a4eb-dfa5f8489046\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-11T03:10:58.946Z\",\"sourceToolAssistantUUID\":\"b0cbf225-21c5-4efc-8c9a-0772a4613d71\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"2fcdb910-d4f7-4670-a4eb-dfa5f8489046\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"userType\":\"external\",\"cwd\":\"/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue\",\"sessionId\":\"64a1054d-d5d1-470b-988c-6d3926af5d5d\",\"version\":\"2.1.32\",\"gitBranch\":\"main\",\"agentId\":\"a1f5895\",\"slug\":\"ticklish-crafting-duckling\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-6\",\"id\":\"msg_01K4vfESAA425zXcRttv63Cu\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_017CZ9ZGBbU65NtLFvSaFnky\",\"name\":\"Read\",\"input\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue/lib/live_vue/ssr.ex\"}}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":3,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":14854,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":14854},\"output_tokens\":2,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"}},\"requestId\":\"req_011CY1Yn2tJUgmnJYMGC5W8G\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"f77bfd3f-89b1-46f2-9b4d-10b39c428744\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-11